<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Alexandros Mavrokordatos</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1791–1865</span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Alexandros Mavrokordatos was a Phanariote Greek statesman of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/greek-war-of-independence">Greek War of Independence</a>. In 1821 he organised the provisional administration of Western Continental <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/greece">Greece</a>, and in 1822 he became president of the executive of the First Hellenic Republic. He defended <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/missolonghi">Missolonghi</a> in 1822–1823 and later served several times as prime minister of the Kingdom of Greece.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/alexandros-mavrokordatos.jpg" alt="Alexandros Mavrokordatos" width="320" height="402" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Anonymous European author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Alexandros_Mavrokordatos.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
